  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2302.02 Application Form, Where Available",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2302.02 Application Form, Where Available. The department shall furnish application forms for vessel registrations at the following locations:\n\n(a) Division of Motor Vehicles\n\nStephen E. Merrill Building\n\n23 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, N.H. 03305;\n\n(b) Division of State Police\n\nBureau of Marine Patrol\n\n31 Dock Road\n\nGilford, N.H. 03249;\n\n(c) Any substation; and\n\n(d) Any vessel agent’s place of business.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss by #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
